3763:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_uart.c ****   * @brief DMA UART transmit process complete callback.
3764:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_uart.c ****   * @param hdma DMA handle.
3765:Drivers/STM32WBxx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32wbxx_hal_uart.c ****   * @retval None
